        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the mystery, explore the shadows lurking within human nature!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779920/extras/dbe09afca8c84d7c6a2bf940454a835d.avif?t=1761273773\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a difficult journey, Ada has found her sister and officially become a detective. Various cases soon follow. This time, Ada is hired by a painter's wife to search for her missing husband, Ben, within a castle on the remote  Island. Yet, this ancient fortress, filled with strange paintings, hides far more than the truth behind a disappearance case—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The twisted father-son relationship between the adopted son Jared and the castle's master, Frank... the conspiracy behind the butler's bizarre death... the hallucinogenic drug coveted by a mysterious organization...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst layers of shocking twists, the darkness and complexity of human nature are quietly rising to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779920/extras/56633f497c5bca7d178794c9253a2c03.avif?t=1761273773\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Suspense Thriller:</strong> A tightly woven plot full of suspense. From awakening with amnesia to uncovering the truth, each twist will shatter your expectations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Puzzles:</strong> Break through illusions, collect crucial items, search for clues – piece together the fragments of truth with your wits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Aesthetic Experience:</strong> Immersive visuals and sound design perfectly recreate the castle's haunting atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779920/extras/796ae0a1eaa30cf52c912cc1b581dfa2.avif?t=1761273773\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Critical Plot Points:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fatal Misunderstanding:</strong> How did an invitation addressed to the wrong name and an undelivered painting lead to a tragic father-son rift?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deceptive Identities:</strong> Nothing in the castle seems certain. Who is impersonating others in the shadows?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Twist:</strong> The castle's treasure is undeniably alluring, but is this truly the goal of the treasure hunt?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779920/extras/d2b76e2d471855c1622816f341d1939a.avif?t=1761273773\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Mystery Island: Enigmatic Painting&quot;</strong> – The truth lies hidden in every tap. Follow Ada's footsteps and unravel the mystery step by step!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779920/extras/686683c993759942d9792189585dd5d1.avif?t=1761273773\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the mystery, explore the shadows lurking within human nature!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779920/extras/dbe09afca8c84d7c6a2bf940454a835d.avif?t=1761273773\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a difficult journey, Ada has found her sister and officially become a detective. Various cases soon follow. This time, Ada is hired by a painter's wife to search for her missing husband, Ben, within a castle on the remote  Island. Yet, this ancient fortress, filled with strange paintings, hides far more than the truth behind a disappearance case—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The twisted father-son relationship between the adopted son Jared and the castle's master, Frank... the conspiracy behind the butler's bizarre death... the hallucinogenic drug coveted by a mysterious organization...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst layers of shocking twists, the darkness and complexity of human nature are quietly rising to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779920/extras/56633f497c5bca7d178794c9253a2c03.avif?t=1761273773\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Suspense Thriller:</strong> A tightly woven plot full of suspense. From awakening with amnesia to uncovering the truth, each twist will shatter your expectations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Puzzles:</strong> Break through illusions, collect crucial items, search for clues – piece together the fragments of truth with your wits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Aesthetic Experience:</strong> Immersive visuals and sound design perfectly recreate the castle's haunting atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779920/extras/796ae0a1eaa30cf52c912cc1b581dfa2.avif?t=1761273773\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Critical Plot Points:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fatal Misunderstanding:</strong> How did an invitation addressed to the wrong name and an undelivered painting lead to a tragic father-son rift?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deceptive Identities:</strong> Nothing in the castle seems certain. Who is impersonating others in the shadows?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Twist:</strong> The castle's treasure is undeniably alluring, but is this truly the goal of the treasure hunt?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779920/extras/d2b76e2d471855c1622816f341d1939a.avif?t=1761273773\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Mystery Island: Enigmatic Painting&quot;</strong> – The truth lies hidden in every tap. Follow Ada's footsteps and unravel the mystery step by step!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779920/extras/686683c993759942d9792189585dd5d1.avif?t=1761273773\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p>",
